From: homebrew-speedcrunch packaging
Subject: Fix GitHub Light resource filename case

Linux filesystems are case-sensitive. The resource collection refers to
"GitHub light.json", while the tracked file is named "GitHub Light.json".

--- a/src/resources/speedcrunch.qrc
+++ b/src/resources/speedcrunch.qrc
@@ -71,6 +71,6 @@
         <file>color-schemes/One Dark.json</file>
         <file>color-schemes/Monokai.json</file>
         <file>color-schemes/GitHub Dark.json</file>
-        <file>color-schemes/GitHub light.json</file>
+        <file>color-schemes/GitHub Light.json</file>
         <file>color-schemes/Gruvbox Dark.json</file>
         <file>color-schemes/Gruvbox Light.json</file>
